error: cannot tell what an empty `[]` is a list of
  --> 001_empty_list_literal.cn:13:14
   13 |     var xs = []
      |              ^^ nothing here ever says what this list holds
  help: An empty `[]` takes its element type from what is later done with it — a `push`, a return, an argument whose type is already known. Nothing here pinned it down. Annotate the binding — `var xs: list[int32] = []` — or start the list with the elements it should hold.

